{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOL","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约珥书","commonName":"约珥书","title":"约珥书","order":29,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"4fea8c005c758b8ea3fc142a25986d04841b2568dee52423510110df5b5a87e8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":73},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华审判的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你们要在锡安吹响号角，",{"text":"在我的圣山上发出警讯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"此地的居民都要颤抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的日子将要来临，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已经近了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是昏暗阴沉的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是乌云密布的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来了一支空前绝后、强盛无比的大军，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们像曙光一样布满山岭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"它们前面有燎原之火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"后面有熊熊烈焰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们到来之前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地就像伊甸园；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们过去之后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地变成荒凉的旷野。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的一切都逃不过这一场浩劫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"它们的形状像马，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"疾驰如战马，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在山岭上跳跃奔腾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如隆隆战车，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像烈火吞噬干草的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如大军列阵备战。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓一看到它们，就惊慌失措，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"面如死灰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们快速奔跑像勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攀登城墙如战士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有条不紊地前进。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"队伍整齐，各行其道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"长驱直入，势不可挡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们冲向城邑，蹿上城墙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爬进房屋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如盗贼般破窗而入。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"所到之处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天摇地动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日月昏暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"星辰无光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华向祂的军队发号施令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的队伍不计其数，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"执行祂命令的是劲旅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的日子伟大而可畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能承受得住呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼吁人民悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“现在你们要禁食、哭泣、哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全心回转归向我。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要撕心般地痛悔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而不是撕裂衣服。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"归向你们的上帝耶和华吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂有恩典、好怜悯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不轻易发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"充满慈爱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不忍心降灾祸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或许祂转念心生怜悯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给你们留下祝福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们可以再次向你们的上帝耶和华献上素祭和奠祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有谁知道呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"要在锡安山吹响号角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣布禁食的圣日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"举行庄严的聚会。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要招聚老人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聚集孩童和吃奶的婴儿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要吩咐新郎出洞房、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新娘出内室；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要召集全体人民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让会众洁净自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"让事奉耶和华的祭司站在圣殿门廊和祭坛中间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭泣恳求说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顾惜你的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要让外族人侮辱、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讥笑你的产业说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘他们的上帝在哪里呢？’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["再赐祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和华笃爱祂的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂怜悯自己的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂回应他们说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我必赐五谷、新酒和橄榄油给你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们饱足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再让你们受列国的羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使北方的军队远离你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他们驱逐到一个干旱荒芜的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他们的领头部队赶进死海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再把他们的殿后部队赶进地中海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时他们必臭气冲天、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶味上腾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华为你们行了大事。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"土地啊，不要害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒要欢喜快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华行了大事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的走兽啊，不要害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为青草铺遍了旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"树木也结满了果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无花果树和葡萄树都结实累累。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"锡安的人民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你们的上帝耶和华而喜乐。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂按时","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"降下甘霖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像从前一样赐给你们秋雨和","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"春雨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"麦场必堆满五谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"酒槽里的酒和油槽里的油必满溢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"“我派蝻虫、蚱蜢、蚂蚱","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和蝗虫大军在那些年所吃掉的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要补偿你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必吃得饱足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并赞美你们的上帝耶和华的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因祂为你们行了奇事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民永远不会再蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，你们就知道我在以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道我是你们的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外别无他神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民永远不会再蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"“以后，我要将我的灵浇灌所有的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的儿女要说预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"老人要做异梦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"青年要见异象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那些日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要将我的灵浇灌我的奴仆和婢女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["“我要在天上地下行奇事，你们将看见血、火和烟柱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["太阳要变得昏暗，月亮要变得血红。在耶和华伟大而可畏的日子来临以前，这些事都会发生。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["那时候，凡求告耶和华之名的人都必得救，因为在锡安山，在耶路撒冷城，必有逃脱灾难的人，耶和华所呼召的人必幸存下来，正如耶和华所言。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“按时”希伯来文是“按公义”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":23}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}